 colorlevels                    Choices: auto limited full (default: auto)
 primaries                      Choices: auto bt.601-525 bt.601-625 bt.709 bt.2020 bt.470m apple adobe prophoto cie1931 dci-p3 display-p3 v-gamut s-gamut ebu3213 film-c aces-ap0 aces-ap1 (default: auto)
 gamma                          Choices: auto bt.1886 srgb linear gamma1.8 gamma2.0 gamma2.2 gamma2.4 gamma2.6 gamma2.8 prophoto pq hlg v-log s-log1 s-log2 st428 (default: auto)
 transfer                       alias for gamma
