 light                          Choices: auto display hlg 709-1886 gamma1.2 (default: auto)
 chroma-location                Choices: unknown uhd mpeg2/4/h264 mpeg1/jpeg top bottom-left bottom (default: unknown)
 stereo-in                      Choices: no mono sbs2l ab2r ab2l checkr checkl irr irl icr icl arcc sbs2r agmc al ar (default: mono)
